      "base_address": "0x4000B000",
      "silicon_erratum_note": "Retains contract bus key 'TWIM1' for 1-to-1 INTERFACE_CONTRACT.json parity. On nRF5340 silicon, SPIM1 (ADXL372) and TWIM1 share Peripheral ID 9 (0x40009000) and cannot run concurrently; therefore firmware DTS routes this PMIC I2C bus to physical silicon instance TWIM2 (Peripheral ID 11, 0x4000B000) via the P0.23/P0.24 GPIO crossbar.",
